        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking is simple: visit our website, select the &quot;Greater Noida to Kerala&quot; route, enter your pickup and delivery addresses, indicate the volume of goods, and choose any extra services such as fragile‑item handling. After submitting, you receive an instant estimate and a dedicated move coordinator contacts you to confirm the schedule and payment.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity move from Noida to Kerala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, proof of residence at both origin and destination (utility bill or rental agreement), the signed moving contract, and a copy of the GST invoice for corporate or government reimbursements. If you are transporting a vehicle, the registration certificate and insurance papers are also mandatory.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the 100% insurance coverage optional or mandatory for my shipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance is mandatory for all Greater Noida to Kerala relocations. It covers the full declared value of your goods against loss, theft, or damage during transit. In the rare event of a claim, you receive a swift settlement based on the documented value and condition of the items.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my belongings in real time during the Noida‑Kerala transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You can view the exact position, estimated arrival time, and checkpoint status. Alerts are also sent via SMS or email whenever the shipment passes a major toll or customs checkpoint.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for a household move from Noida to Kerala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the journey along NH‑19 takes approximately 14‑16 hours of driving time, spread over 2‑3 days to allow for safe loading, unloading, and mandatory rest stops. Seasonal factors such as monsoon rains or festival traffic can add an extra day, which we communicate in advance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are fragile items like glassware or temple idols protected?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer protective packaging system starts with high‑density bubble cushioning, followed by multi‑ply corrugated sheets, foam edge protectors, and custom wooden crates for delicate pieces. Each fragile item is individually wrapped, labeled, and secured with ratchet lashings to prevent movement during the long highway haul.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do the rates for greater noida to kerala transport services include fuel surcharge and tolls?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our transparent cost matrix incorporates the base freight charge, fuel surcharge, toll fees, insurance premium, and any optional services you select. There are no hidden fees; the final invoice reflects exactly what was quoted in the instant estimate, ensuring peace of mind for both residential and corporate clients.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
